      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 699496075264
    m_Localized: Press 'F' and shoot at enemies!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 726557724672
    m_Localized: 'Try to climb. You need to know this for the continuation of the
      game.

      Quickly try these combinations:

      jump - hold on to the wall
      - pull away from the wall and jump again - repeat'
